OL,3,GNEWSAHow one ex-offender is breaking   
OL,4,Acycles of crime                        
OL,6,FAfter years caught in a cycle of crime,
OL,7,Fprison and addiction, a man once       
OL,8,Fdescribed by a judge as "the most      
OL,9,Fdangerous amputee in the country" is   
OL,10,Fnow helping young people avoid         
OL,11,Foffending and exploitation.            
OL,13,FChris Baker, 41, from north London,    
OL,14,Fspent nine years in prison between 2006
OL,15,Fand 2020 for offences including        
OL,16,Fburglary, robbery, drink-driving and   
OL,17,Fdrug-related crime.                    
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
