OL,3,GNEWSAHow one ex-offender is breaking   
OL,4,Acycles of crime                        
OL,6,FA 120mph crash on a stolen motorcycle  
OL,7,Fin 2008 cost Baker his right arm. He   
OL,8,Fwas drunk, high on cocaine and already 
OL,9,Fbanned from driving when police began  
OL,10,Fpursuing him.                          
OL,12,FBaker, who now mentors young people,   
OL,13,Fhas shared his story in Built          
OL,14,FDifferent, a book which recounts his   
OL,15,Fcriminal past and his troubled         
OL,16,Fchildhood in Tottenham.                
